        body: 'Career progression paths: Data Analyst → Senior Analyst → Lead Analyst → Manager of Analytics → Director of Data Science/Analytics. Differentiation strategies: develop specialty in a high-growth area (RWE, AI-assisted analytics, clinical data engineering), obtain relevant certifications (SAS Advanced Programmer, Databricks Data Engineer, Coursera Data Science specialization), contribute to publications or conference presentations (JSM, PhUSE, DIA meetings are key pharma data science conferences), and develop domain expertise in a specific therapeutic area (oncology, rare disease, CNS) — therapeutic area expertise plus analytical skills commands significant salary premium.',
